"leaves `EnabledNativeTools = '[]'` for existing agent rows. Agents that "
"were migrated from `config.bots` therefore do not automatically gain "
"native web search at upgrade time. To enable native web search for a "
"migrated agent, edit the agent on the **Agents** page and turn on "
"**Enable Web Search** under the **Configuration** tab."
