"**Reasoning is on by default for migrated agents.** Migration 000006 "
"backfills `ReasoningEnabled = true` for existing rows. If your "
"environment relies on agents *not* using extended thinking — for example,"
" to reduce token spend or to keep latency predictable for a particular "
"agent — explicitly turn off **Reasoning Enabled** on each affected agent "
"after the upgrade."
